{% if not settings.accountFees.isCost and fee_rows is not empty %}
    <p class="note">
        Opłaty są pokazane, ale nie wchodzą do kosztów —
        <a href="#settings">zmienisz to w Ustawieniach</a> („Opłaty rachunkowe”).
    </p>
{% endif %}
<div class="table-wrapper table-wrapper--editable">
    <table class="table table--editable">
        <thead><tr><th>Opis</th><th>Kategoria</th><th>Data waluty</th><th>Waluta</th><th>Kwota</th><th>Korekta / zwrot</th><th>Uwzględnij w kosztach</th><th>Źródło</th><th>Usuń</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody data-editor-body="fees">
        {% for index, row in fee_rows %}
            <tr id="row-{{ row.id }}" data-row-id="{{ row.id }}">
                <td><input type="hidden" name="fees[{{ index }}][id]" value="{{ row.id }}"><input name="fees[{{ index }}][description]" value="{{ row.description }}" required></td>
                <td>
                    <select name="fees[{{ index }}][category]" aria-label="Kategoria opłaty, wiersz {{ index + 1 }}" required>
                        {% for category in fee_categories %}<option value="{{ category }}" {{ row.category == category ? 'selected' : '' }}>{{ category }}</option>{% endfor %}
                        {# A value from before the list keeps an option, or the next post would lose it. #}
                        {% if row.category != '' and row.category not in fee_categories %}<option value="{{ row.category }}" selected>{{ row.category }}</option>{% endif %}
                    </select>
                </td>
                <td><input type="date" name="fees[{{ index }}][value_date]" value="{{ row.value_date }}" required></td>
                <td><input name="fees[{{ index }}][currency]" value="{{ row.currency }}" size="4" required></td>
                <td><input name="fees[{{ index }}][amount]" value="{{ row.amount }}" size="10" inputmode="decimal" required></td>
                <td><label class="toggle-label"><input type="hidden" name="fees[{{ index }}][correction]" value="0"><input type="checkbox" name="fees[{{ index }}][correction]" value="1" {{ row.correction == '1' ? 'checked' : '' }}> Tak</label></td>
                <td><label class="toggle-label"><input type="hidden" name="fees[{{ index }}][included]" value="0"><input type="checkbox" name="fees[{{ index }}][included]" value="1" {{ row.included == '1' ? 'checked' : '' }}> Tak</label></td>
                <td class="cell--source">{{ row.source ?: 'ręcznie' }}<input type="hidden" name="fees[{{ index }}][source]" value="{{ row.source }}"></td>
                <td class="cell--remove"><button type="submit" class="button button--link row-remove" name="fees[{{ index }}][remove]" value="1" formaction="{{ path('app_calculator_result') }}#panel-fees" formnovalidate data-row-remove aria-label="Usuń opłatę {{ index + 1 }}">Usuń</button></td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
{% if fee_rows is empty %}<p class="note">Brak samodzielnych opłat rachunkowych.</p>{% endif %}
{% if report is not null and report.stock.accountingFees is not empty %}
    <h3>Przeliczenia uwzględnionych opłat</h3>
    <div class="table-wrapper"><table class="table table--compact"><thead><tr><th>Opis</th><th>Data</th><th>Kwota</th><th>Kurs NBP / data</th><th>Wpływ na koszt PLN</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    {% for item in report.stock.accountingFees %}<tr><th>{{ item.fee.description }}</th><td>{{ item.fee.valueDate|date('Y-m-d') }}</td><td>{{ item.exchanged.original|money_with_currency }}</td><td>{{ item.exchanged.rate }} / {{ item.exchanged.rateDate ? item.exchanged.rateDate|date('Y-m-d') : 'PLN' }}</td><td>{{ item.costImpact|money }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody></table></div>
{% endif %}
<p class="note">
    <strong>Korekta / zwrot</strong> — zaznacz, gdy broker oddał pieniądze, np. zwrócił pobraną
    wcześniej opłatę. Taka kwota zmniejsza koszty zamiast je zwiększać. <strong>Uwzględnij
    w kosztach</strong> pozwala pominąć pojedynczą opłatę. Opłaty z tej zakładki nie są
    przypisywane do żadnego kraju w PIT/ZG.
</p>
<p class="note">
    Nie ma tu prowizji ani podatków od transakcji: prowizje są już w kwotach zakupu i sprzedaży,
    a podatek od transakcji (np. francuski) z zestawienia konta doliczamy do kwoty zakupu,
    którego dotyczy — widać go w zakładce Transakcje. Zobacz też
    <a href="https://www.podatki.gov.pl/media/11079/broszura-do-pit-38-za-2025-r.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer">broszurę MF do PIT-38 za 2025 r.</a>
</p>
<template data-row-template="fees"><tr data-row-id="">
    <td><input type="hidden" name="fees[__INDEX__][id]" value=""><input name="fees[__INDEX__][description]" required></td><td><select name="fees[__INDEX__][category]" aria-label="Kategoria opłaty" required>{% for category in fee_categories %}<option value="{{ category }}" {{ category == 'Inne' ? 'selected' : '' }}>{{ category }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></td><td><input type="date" name="fees[__INDEX__][value_date]" required></td><td><input name="fees[__INDEX__][currency]" size="4" required></td><td><input name="fees[__INDEX__][amount]" size="10" inputmode="decimal" required></td>
    <td><label class="toggle-label"><input type="hidden" name="fees[__INDEX__][correction]" value="0"><input type="checkbox" name="fees[__INDEX__][correction]" value="1"> Tak</label></td><td><label class="toggle-label"><input type="hidden" name="fees[__INDEX__][included]" value="0"><input type="checkbox" name="fees[__INDEX__][included]" value="1" checked> Tak</label></td><td class="cell--source">ręcznie<input type="hidden" name="fees[__INDEX__][source]" value="ręcznie"></td><td class="cell--remove"><button type="submit" class="button button--link row-remove" name="fees[__INDEX__][remove]" value="1" formaction="{{ path('app_calculator_result') }}#panel-fees" formnovalidate data-row-remove aria-label="Usuń opłatę">Usuń</button></td>
</tr></template>
